codex
Both prior blockers are resolved in the checks completed so far. All 16 saved cases now HOLD, and 16 additional writer-to-overlay checks pass, covering missing, zero, boundary, legacy and regional scores. The saved runtime audit also reproduces. I’m writing the closure report with the distinction between this local replay and full-runtime recomposition.

